          "settings": {
            "question": "Which documents does a Broward building department want for a glass railing permit?",
            "answer": "<p>Expect to show where the railing goes, the height, and how the spigots attach, because the HVHZ review focuses on attachment. Our engineering and testing page has the documents for top-mount and side-mount spigots on concrete and on wood, with blocking details. Product pages give the panel and spigot dimensions. Each city in Broward runs its own permit office under the county's Board of Rules and Appeals, so call yours first.</p>",
